        quick_answer="Tap water in Turkmenistan requires caution. Ashgabat&rsquo;s centralized system provides treated water, but supply is intermittent in many neighborhoods, and the rest of the country faces severe water quality and scarcity challenges linked to the Karakum Desert climate.",
