        regional="Ashgabat has the best infrastructure, though supply interruptions occur. Mary and Turkmenabat have basic treatment but inconsistent quality. The Dashoguz region near the former Aral Sea shore has severely contaminated water with high salt content and pesticide residues. Desert settlements along the Karakum Canal receive minimally treated canal water.",
